{"title": "Astral Conduit (Condition)", "pageid": 32407, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Astral_Conduit_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has tick type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Utility Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/22/Generic_Utility_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Astral Conduit</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The affected entity can't move, take actions, bonus actions, or reactions while holding open the <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\">Astral Rift</a>, but can <a href=\"/wiki/Extraplanar_Summons\" title=\"Extraplanar Summons\">Summon</a> an ally every other turn. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Loses duration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Duration\" title=\"Conditions\">Loses duration</a>: start of turn</div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\">Grants:</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Extraplanar_Summons\" title=\"Extraplanar Summons\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/40px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/60px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/80px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Extraplanar Summons\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp/40px-Action_Surge_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4d/Action_Surge_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Extraplanar_Summons\" title=\"Extraplanar Summons\">Extraplanar Summons</a> </dt>\n<dd>Pull an ally into battle through the open <a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\">Astral Rift</a>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Every other turn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Every other turn.)</dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Astral_Conduit\">Sources of Astral Conduit</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astral Rift\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Astral_Rift\" title=\"Astral Rift\">Astral Rift</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creatures_with_Astral_Conduit\">Creatures with Astral Conduit</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ri%27zel\" title=\"Ri'zel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Ri%27zel.png/30px-Portrait_Ri%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Ri%27zel.png/45px-Portrait_Ri%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Ri%27zel.png/60px-Portrait_Ri%27z